{
  "enabled": false,
  "name": "Smart Architecture Check",
  "description": "TEMPORARY: Reminds to follow Odoo/ERPNext patterns. Will be replaced by ESLint custom rules (Week 5+)",
  "version": "2",
  "when": {
    "type": "preToolUse",
    "toolTypes": ["write"]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "⚠️ TEMPORARY HOOK (Will be replaced by ESLint rules Week 5+)\n\nYou are about to write a file. If this is a TypeScript service or entity file in domains/ (e.g., *.service.ts, *.entity.ts), verify:\n\n1. ✅ Using SecureRepository (not raw TypeORM)?\n2. ✅ Tenant isolation included?\n3. ✅ Permission checks (canRead/canWrite/canDelete)?\n4. ✅ Audit trail (createdBy, updatedBy, deletedAt)?\n5. ✅ Following Odoo/ERPNext patterns?\n6. ✅ For tests: Mocking SecureRepository methods (find/save/remove)?\n\nNOTE: ESLint custom rules are being implemented to replace this hook with objective, deterministic detection.\n\nIf this is NOT a service/entity file (e.g., documentation, config, test), you can proceed without these checks.\n\n**AUTONOMOUS WORKING:** Confirm compliance or state this is not a code file, then PROCEED IMMEDIATELY. Don't wait for user input."
  }
}
